> Module Apoio

# Arithmetic helpers (not independent legal rules)

All amounts use exact decimal arithmetic until explicit money conversion.
`separada` elsewhere means married/união de facto filing separately, not an
unmarried individual. Household limits are halved in that case under art. 78
n.º 14. Expenses must already be allocated to the return under n.os 9–14.

```catala-metadata
declaration minimo content money depends on a content money, b content money
  equals if a <= b then a else b

declaration positivo content money depends on a content money
  equals if a > $0 then a else $0

declaration limite_agregado content money depends on limite content money, separada content boolean
  equals if separada then money of ((decimal of limite) / 2.0) else limite

declaration deducao_limitada content money
  depends on despesas content money, taxa content decimal, limite content money
  equals minimo of (money of ((decimal of despesas) * taxa)), limite
```
